            "id": "f9FE1I4QEv",
            "type": "header",
            "data": {
                "text": "The Ottablog Kitchensink",
                "level": 1
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "P8cvY45gey",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "data": {
                "text": "Every block OttaEditor can write, on one page, in the order you would meet them. Scroll through it once to see how your theme handles text, media, and the interactive bits — then <b>edit it, break it, or delete it</b>. Nothing here is precious."
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "X1kXlgRZH9",
            "type": "header",
            "data": {
                "text": "Text Blocks",
                "level": 2
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "X9m30DLRk-",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "data": {
                "text": "The everyday workhorse. A paragraph carries <i>italic</i> for emphasis, <b>bold</b> for the thing readers must not miss, and <code>inline code</code> for the exact string they need to type. Most of a good post is just this block, used well."
            }
        },
